      <span class="breadcrumb-sep">/</span>
      <span class="breadcrumb-current">常見問題</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="subhero-title">常見問題</h1>
    <p class="subhero-subtitle">關於 EBiM 競賽的快速解答。還有疑問嗎？歡迎在 <a href="https://discord.gg/pGwRbMRjuH" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a> 提問。</p>
  </div>
