<section id="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="faq-shell fade-in">

      <p class="faq-updated">
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>
        {% endraw %}{% set _iso = page.inputPath | gitDateISO %}{% if _iso %}<time datetime="{{ _iso }}">最後更新 {{ _iso | humanDate("zh-tw") }}</time>{% else %}<span>最近更新</span>{% endif %}{% raw %}
      </p>

      <div class="faq-grid">
        <nav class="faq-rail" aria-label="常見問題分類">
          <p class="faq-rail-h">分類</p>
          <button class="faq-cat is-active" data-target="faq-g1"><svg class="faq-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3v18"/><path d="M5 4h13l-3 4 3 4H5z"/></svg><span class="faq-cat-n">入門</span><span class="faq-cat-c">6</span></button>
          <button class="faq-cat" data-target="faq-g2"><svg class="faq-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H6"/><path d="M18 9h1.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5H18"/><path d="M4 22h16"/><path d="M10 14.66V17c0 .55-.47.98-.97 1.21C7.85 18.75 7 20.24 7 22"/><path d="M14 14.66V17c0 .55.47.98.97 1.21C16.15 18.75 17 20.24 17 22"/><path d="M18 2H6v7a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V2Z"/></svg><span class="faq-cat-n">競賽</span><span class="faq-cat-c">6</span></button>
          <button class="faq-cat" data-target="faq-g3"><svg class="faq-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="16" height="16" x="4" y="4" rx="2"/><rect width="6" height="6" x="9" y="9" rx="1"/><path d="M9 2v2"/><path d="M15 2v2"/><path d="M9 20v2"/><path d="M15 20v2"/><path d="M2 9h2"/><path d="M2 15h2"/><path d="M20 9h2"/><path d="M20 15h2"/></svg><span class="faq-cat-n">運算資源</span><span class="faq-cat-c">2</span></button>
          <button class="faq-cat" data-target="faq-g4"><svg class="faq-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526"/></svg><span class="faq-cat-n">AMD Solution Award</span><span class="faq-cat-c">1</span></button>
          <button class="faq-cat" data-target="faq-g5"><svg class="faq-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"/></svg><span class="faq-cat-n">保持聯繫</span><span class="faq-cat-c">1</span></button>
        </nav>

        <div class="faq-cards">
          <section class="faq-card" id="faq-g1">
            <div class="faq-card-h"><svg class="faq-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3v18"/><path d="M5 4h13l-3 4 3 4H5z"/></svg><h2>入門</h2><span class="faq-card-c">6 個問題</span></div>
            <div class="faq-qa is-open"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="true"><span class="faq-q-t">如何報名？</span><svg class="faq-chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><p>在<a href="register.html">報名頁面</a>登記 1–6 人的隊伍。Member 1 為聯絡人，負責接收所有隊伍電子郵件。</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-qa is-open"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="true"><span class="faq-q-t">需要報名費嗎？</span><svg class="faq-chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><p>不需要——參賽完全免費。</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-qa is-open"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="true"><span class="faq-q-t">可以單人參賽嗎？還是需要自行組隊？</span><svg class="faq-chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><p>每隊 1–6 人，允許單人參賽，並由您自行組隊。想找隊友嗎？可使用我們的 <a href="https://discord.gg/pGwRbMRjuH" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Discord</a>，中國大陸參賽者也可加入<a href="https://qr61.cn/oioUKl/qtksKk2" target="_blank" rel="noopener">上海測試平台微信群組</a>。</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-qa is-open"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="true"><span class="faq-q-t">需要什麼程度的經驗？</span><svg class="faq-chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><p>歡迎各種程度的參賽者——我們提供基線範例與教學。</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-qa is-open"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="true"><span class="faq-q-t">送出報名後，可以更改隊伍名稱或更新報名資料嗎？</span><svg class="faq-chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><p>可以——請重新送出報名表單，並填入包括更正內容在內的所有資料。更新僅受理完整的重新送出（我們以您最新一次送出的內容為準），因此請重新完整填寫隊伍資料，而非以其他方式寄送更改。隊伍名稱須使用拉丁（英文）字母，並與各表單保持一致。</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-qa is-open"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="true"><span class="faq-q-t">報名後會收到確認信嗎？</span><svg class="faq-chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><p>貴隊的聯絡人（成員一）將透過電子郵件收到競賽公告與更新——系統不會即時自動回覆，請耐心等候並檢查垃圾郵件匣。若您已報名但尚未收到我們的來信，報名仍然有效；公告會寄送至每一位聯絡人的電子郵件信箱。</p></div></div>
          </section>

          <section class="faq-card" id="faq-g2">
            <div class="faq-card-h"><svg class="faq-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H6"/><path d="M18 9h1.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5H18"/><path d="M4 22h16"/><path d="M10 14.66V17c0 .55-.47.98-.97 1.21C7.85 18.75 7 20.24 7 22"/><path d="M14 14.66V17c0 .55.47.98.97 1.21C16.15 18.75 17 20.24 17 22"/><path d="M18 2H6v7a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V2Z"/></svg><h2>競賽</h2><span class="faq-card-c">6 個問題</span></div>
            <div class="faq-qa is-open"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="true"><span class="faq-q-t">有哪些賽題？</span><svg class="faq-chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><p>三個獨立賽題——任務 1：纜線佈線與插接；任務 2：可變形物體操作（導熱墊放置）；任務 3：輔助生活與餵食。可任選一項或多項參加，各賽題獨立排名。</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-qa is-open"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="true"><span class="faq-q-t">使用哪些模擬器？</span><svg class="faq-chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><p>NVIDIA Isaac Sim 與 MuJoCo。開發者預覽版中並非所有任務/模擬器組合皆已就緒——請查看 <a href="https://github.com/EBiM-Benchmark/benchmark/blob/main/STATUS.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">STATUS.md</a> 了解目前的就緒狀態矩陣。（例如，任務 2 的 MuJoCo 版本尚未隨版本釋出；若您自行建置，仍然有效。）</p></div></div>
            <div class="faq-qa is-open"><button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="true"><span class="faq-q-t">提供哪些遙控操作介面？</span><svg class="faq-chev" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></button><div class="faq-a"><p>Teleoperation Toolkit 現已釋出三種介面：<a href="https://franka.de/de/gello" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Franka Duo GELLO</a>（用於操作），以及鍵盤控制與 USB 腳踏板控制（用於移動底盤）。VR 控制尚未釋出。</p></div></div>
